<title>SINGAPORE: Hind Hotels 1996 net profit up 34.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Hind Hotels 1996 net profit up 34.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 6.69   vs   4.97</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)	   2.00   vs   1.00</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)     10.14   vs   7.50</p>
<p>    Turnover		  38.12   vs  38.20</p>
<p>    Operating profit	17.85   vs  15.72</p>
<p>    Interest expense	 7.72   vs   7.84</p>
<p>    Depreciation	     2.15   vs   1.98</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   7.98   vs   5.89</p>
<p>    Tax			  1.29   vs   0.93</p>
<p>    Dividend pay date:     July 22, 1997</p>
<p>Last date books open:  July 9, 1997</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Hind Hotels International Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
